<title>SPAIN: Spain's Rato postpones Thursday Senate appearance.</title>
<headline>Spain's Rato postpones Thursday Senate appearance.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato postponed an appearance in the Senate scheduled for Thursday afternoon because he had come down with influenza, the Economy Ministry said.</p>
<p>Rato was to talk about the most recent ECOFIN meeting at 1600 GMT.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
